1. BASE - Bielefeld Academic Search Engine | Services
   URL: http://api.base-search.net/
   BASE (Bielefeld Academic Search Engine) harvests metadata of academic web resources (mainly repositories and journals) via OAI-PMH. It is based on the open source search engine software Lucene/SOLR. Currently more than 12,000 content providers and more than 400 million documents are covered in BASE and grouped into different collections.
2. BASE OAI Interface 3.2 documentation
